SIMPLE  =                    T /  conforms to FITS standard                     BITPIX  =                   16 /  array data type                               NAXIS   =                    0 / number of array dimensions                     EXTEND  =                    T /                                                TELESCOP= 'HST     '                                                            INSTRUME= 'ACS     '                                                            DETECTOR= 'WFC     '                                                            FILENAME= '4bb1536lj_npl.fits' / Name of file                                   FILETYPE= 'DXY GRID'           /Type of data found in data file                 DATE    = '2020-08-11'                                                          NEXTEND =                    4 /Number of standard extensions                   OBSTYPE = 'IMAGING '           /Type of observation                             FILTER1 = 'CLEAR1L '           /Element selected from filter wheel 1            FILTER2 = 'F814W   '           /Element selected from filter wheel 2            USEAFTER= 'Mar 01 2002 00:00:00' /                                              DESCRIP = 'Non-polynomial filter dependent distortion file for ACS/WFC--------' PEDIGREE= 'INFLIGHT 11/11/2002 11/11/2002'                                      ROOTNAME= '4BB1536LJ_NPL'                                                       COMMENT Original NPOLFILE created by V.Kozhurina-Platais May 2019               COMMENT NPOL header updated by V.Kozhurina-Platais August 2020                  HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  After applying the pixel grid irrgularity correction and               HISTORY  best-fitting polynomial, the residuals of the X and Y                  HISTORY  positions between the observed 47Tuc ACS/WFC F606W filter and          HISTORY  X and Y positions from the standard astrometric catalog                HISTORY  (Kozhurina-Platais ACS-ISR-2015-06, improved by Gaia DR2               HISTORY  Kozhurina-Platais, ACS-ISR-2018-01), have shown fine-scale residual    HISTORY  structure at the level of 0.05 pixels. To remove the fine-scale        HISTORY  variations 2-D look-up table has been been created, which is linearly  HISTORY  interpolated at any point in the ACS/WFC images.                       HISTORY  The astrometric errors due to the fine-scale filter induced distortion HISTORY  have been corrected down to the level of ~0.02 pixels in the           HISTORY  calibrated filters.                                                    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  The correction is stored as an image extension with one row            HISTORY  in X and one column in Y. Each element in the row/column               HISTORY  specifies the correction in pixels for every pixels in the column      HISTORY  (or row) in science extension.                                         HISTORY  For ACS/WFC, the correction is in X and Y directions for each WFC CCD  HISTORY  chip.                                                                  HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  Non-polynomial offset file generated from acs_f814w_05072019_npol.fits HISTORY  This is only added to the flt/flc.fits file and used in coordinate     HISTORY  transformations if the npol reference filename is specified in         HISTORY  the header.  The offsets are copied from the reference file into       HISTORY  two arrays for each chip.  Each array is stored as a 64x32 pixel       HISTORY  image that gets interpolated up to the full chip size.  Two new        HISTORY  extensions for each chip are also appended to the flt/flc file         HISTORY  (WCSDVARR) when it is used.                                            HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  This solution does not change with time, but is filter dependent       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  File origionally named: acs_f814w_05072019_npol.fits                   HISTORY wfc_CLEAR1L_F814W_npl.fits renamed to 4bb1536lj_npl.fits on Nov 11 2020 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             XTENSION= 'IMAGE   '           /  Image extension                               BITPIX  =                  -32 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     